1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,010
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:03,610
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,040
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,750
(The day before)

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,720
What is that bag doing here?

6
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:22,530
Did you blackmail the chairman
and steal the bag of money?

7
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,160
I'll report this to him at once.

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,300
Go ahead.

9
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:32,040
Take the bag of money with you.

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,710
What?

11
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:37,240
I don't understand.
What are you even thinking?

12
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,510
I wanted to put him to the test.

13
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:45,050
How much does Park Tae Ho trust you?

14
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,590
Between ten million dollars and you,

15
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,190
which would he value more?

16
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,830
If you became an obstacle,
like CEO Choi Sam Sik,

17
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,630
would he be capable
of killing you too?

18
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:01,570
Is it really safe to stay
by Park Tae Ho's side long term?

19
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:06,940
Park Tae Ho could easily kill you
at any time, too.

20
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:11,110
What do you want from me?

21
00:01:12,210 --> 00:01:14,880
I want to strip Park Tae Ho
of his power.

22
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:18,080
That means removing you,
his protector,

23
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:21,450
and the slush fund account
in your name.

24
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:24,960
I'm going to drain
his entire slush fund.

25
00:01:33,130 --> 00:01:35,870
So, leave Park Tae Ho's side.

26
00:01:36,870 --> 00:01:39,670
In return, I'll pay you
out of this bag of money...

27
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,740
and guarantee your safety.

28
00:01:53,490 --> 00:01:54,950
You were right, Ms. Kim.

29
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:57,820
I dedicated my entire youth
to the chairman,

30
00:01:58,620 --> 00:02:00,260
but I was cast aside in an instant.

31
00:02:01,460 --> 00:02:04,400
He even threatened to kill me.

32
00:02:07,630 --> 00:02:09,830
Please help me get away safely.

33
00:02:10,370 --> 00:02:11,370
Sure.

34
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:13,910
Then, we'll wait
for the private banker to arrive...

35
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:15,010
There's no time.

36
00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:17,140
Since he's getting rid of me,

37
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:19,740
the chairman is going to change
the slush fund account...

38
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:22,980
and probably transfer everything
under someone else's name.

39
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:27,250
Mrs. Han,
is the private banker here yet?

40
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,420
Let me check again.

41
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:37,360
Then why don't you get
the necessary documents ready first?

42
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,200
Sure.

43
00:03:02,150 --> 00:03:04,090
(Total Cash Balance:
USD 159,856,666.70)

44
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:07,860
Where can I move this money?

45
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:11,130
I still can't trust Jung Ran
or Hyun Jun.

46
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:12,730
Good grief.

47
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:15,970
I can't believe there's no one
I can trust with this.

48
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:20,340
- Sir.
- Yes?

49
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:23,040
Manager Kang is acting strangely.

50
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,110
Strangely? How so?

51
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:28,050
He just went into a place
called Ihwachae.

52
00:03:30,350 --> 00:03:32,650
What? Ihwachae?

53
00:03:32,650 --> 00:03:33,990
Isn't that a famous hanbok shop?

54
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:36,850
Did he hide the bag of money there?

55
00:03:37,390 --> 00:03:40,360
- That's where he went in.
- Could it be Kim Dan Hui?

56
00:03:41,830 --> 00:03:43,660
Is she involved in this?

57
00:03:44,930 --> 00:03:46,730
Get to Ihwachae now.

58
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,240
(Total Consolidated Cash Balance:
USD 159,856,666.70)

59
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,040
Identity verification is complete.

60
00:03:58,740 --> 00:04:02,050
With the newly issued security card,
you can now reset your password.

61
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:04,480
Have a good day.

62
00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:08,790
Please hurry.

63
00:04:09,750 --> 00:04:13,560
This is the JKL Partners account.
Please transfer all the funds here.

64
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:14,660
Right.

65
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:20,870
(New Password)

66
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:36,980
If he went to Ihwachae,
he must've met Kim Dan Hui.

67
00:04:37,550 --> 00:04:40,850
Does that mean Kim Dan Hui
used Manager Kang...

68
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,650
to steal the ten million dollars?

69
00:04:42,890 --> 00:04:45,760
She isn't the type to stop
at just ten million dollars.

70
00:04:47,030 --> 00:04:50,600
She might be after my account.
I have to move the money right now.

71
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:53,400
Sir, transfer it to my account.

72
00:04:54,970 --> 00:04:56,230
Not you.

73
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,940
What will you do if you lose it all?

74
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:03,140
Even my son, Park Hyun Jun,
would be a better choice.

75
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:13,180
(Total Consolidated Cash Balance:
USD 159,856,666.70)

76
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,360
(Total Consolidated Cash Balance:
USD 159,856,666.70)

77
00:05:24,230 --> 00:05:25,230
(Error: Access Denied)

78
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:30,170
(Error: Access Denied)

79
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,340
Don't tell me Kim Dan Hui...

80
00:05:34,610 --> 00:05:36,110
Did Kim Dan Hui get to it first?

81
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:43,980
(Total Consolidated Cash Balance:
USD 0.00)

82
00:05:50,290 --> 00:05:51,290
(Total Consolidated Cash Balance:
USD 0.00)

83
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,790
Thankfully, we weren't too late.

84
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:56,260
Yes, we got all
of Park Tae Ho's slush fund.

85
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:03,700
I knew the account in my name
held a massive fortune,

86
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:06,240
but I was afraid my family
would get hurt,

87
00:06:06,940 --> 00:06:08,510
so I never dared to touch it.

88
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:12,280
That's how terrifying
the Chairman is.

89
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,150
I'm getting out now,

90
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:16,780
but you two will be in target range.

91
00:06:20,850 --> 00:06:23,490
Do you think we would've taken
Park Tae Ho's slush fund...

92
00:06:23,490 --> 00:06:24,760
if we weren't ready for this?

93
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:30,130
Don't worry about us.
Just follow Mrs. Han to safety.

94
00:06:38,370 --> 00:06:40,040
Yes, thank you.

95
00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:41,270
Please follow me.

96
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:51,880
I'll get started
on the next part of our plan.

97
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,390
Okay, but be careful.

98
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:11,000
Kim Dan Hui!

99
00:07:15,970 --> 00:07:17,740
Are you Mrs. Han?

100
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:20,340
Where's Kim Dan Hui?

101
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,950
You're as arrogant as ever.

102
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:26,180
What?

103
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:28,890
What... What is this?

104
00:07:34,130 --> 00:07:38,330
If you came to see Ms. Kim Dan Hui,
then see her and leave quietly.

105
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:41,770
If you cause a scene,
I'll have you thrown out.

106
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:52,880
Park Tae Ho.

107
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,650
Your time is almost up.

108
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,990
Kim Dan Hui!

109
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:14,200
How dare you use Manager Kang...

110
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:16,570
to steal my money?

111
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,710
(Total Consolidated Cash Balance:
USD 0.00)

112
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:32,250
Zero dollars!

113
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,520
Sir, your slush fund is...

114
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:40,060
You... How dare you?

115
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:44,600
Where's my money?

116
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:47,930
Bring me my money right now,
or I'll kill you.

117
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:50,900
You're too late.

118
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:54,710
Your money is already
being put to good use.

119
00:08:56,610 --> 00:08:57,610
What?

120
00:09:02,410 --> 00:09:03,810
Today's charity event,

121
00:09:03,810 --> 00:09:06,280
hosted by Adele Group
and JKL Partners,

122
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:09,990
was organized to honor those
who died wrongfully.

123
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,760
In line with the wishes
of the deceased,

124
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:15,960
we'll continue to support
the underprivileged.

125
00:09:16,260 --> 00:09:17,460
(Single Mother Fund:
5 million dollars)

126
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:18,630
(Donor: The late Baek Jun Gi)

127
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:21,330
We'll now present the donations.

128
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:25,100
Now, let's welcome
the representatives one by one.

129
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,370
Please go ahead.

130
00:09:28,370 --> 00:09:30,610
(Single Mother Fund:
5 million dollars)

131
00:09:30,610 --> 00:09:32,810
(Donor: The late Baek Jun Gi)

132
00:09:34,810 --> 00:09:35,980
(Single Mother Fund:
5 million dollars)

133
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:38,280
(Pediatric Cancer Fund:
5 million dollars)

134
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,720
(Donor: The late Kim Myung Hui)

135
00:09:43,190 --> 00:09:46,320
What is this? What kind of show
are they putting on?

136
00:09:46,660 --> 00:09:47,760
A charity event?

137
00:09:48,930 --> 00:09:50,630
A donation, all of a sudden?

138
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,230
Something's not right.

139
00:09:54,930 --> 00:09:57,000
Call Father and find out
what's going on.

140
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,770
What? Oh, of course.

141
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,810
(Underprivileged Assistance Fund,
Donor: The late Choi Sam Sik)

142
00:10:03,010 --> 00:10:07,380
Honey, Park Min Jun
and Baek Jin Ju...

143
00:10:07,450 --> 00:10:10,510
are putting on some charity show,
throwing money around. What...

144
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,080
Wait. What?

145
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:15,920
Kim Dan Hui cleaned out
the slush fund?

146
00:10:21,830 --> 00:10:23,030
(Underprivileged Assistance Fund,
Donor: The late Choi Sam Sik)

147
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,940
My sister Myung Hui,

148
00:10:39,810 --> 00:10:43,150
CEO Baek Jun Gi,
and CEO Choi Sam Sik.

149
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:47,690
The people you wrongfully killed
are the ones who took that money.

150
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:53,460
Be grateful your blood money
is finally being put to good use.

151
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:55,360
Kim Dan Hui!

152
00:10:57,290 --> 00:11:00,730
Hey. Let go. Let go of me!

153
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:03,970
Kim Dan Hui, you'll regret
what you did today.

154
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:07,570
You're going to deeply regret
ever laying a hand on my money.

155
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:09,370
Just you wait, Kim Dan Hui!

156
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:12,080
Let go of me, you punks. Let go.

157
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:20,220
Goodness.

158
00:11:25,090 --> 00:11:26,560
Are you all right?

159
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:29,630
Yes, I'm fine.

160
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:35,370
This was one tough battle.

161
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:45,980
Move!

162
00:11:46,940 --> 00:11:48,580
Stop this right now!

163
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:50,850
That's my money they're giving away.

164
00:11:52,650 --> 00:11:55,290
Who gave you the right to donate it?

165
00:11:55,850 --> 00:11:56,990
All that money...

166
00:11:57,490 --> 00:11:59,160
I told you we should've moved it
to my account.

167
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,690
Why did you even follow me here?

168
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:05,100
You. Stop right now.

169
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,100
Sir!

170
00:12:08,470 --> 00:12:10,530
Park Min Jun is transferring
the money right now.

171
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:14,140
What? Stop him.
We have to stop him now.

172
00:12:14,610 --> 00:12:15,670
Stop him!

173
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:21,850
Park Tae Ho.

174
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:25,080
You don't have the right
to act like the victim.

175
00:12:25,580 --> 00:12:27,650
Think about the people
who were wrongfully killed...

176
00:12:27,990 --> 00:12:30,390
and the pain of those
they left behind.

177
00:12:32,590 --> 00:12:34,830
No wait, just a moment.
Park Min Jun!

178
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:36,390
Just open the door, will you?

179
00:12:36,730 --> 00:12:38,800
That's right. My Hyun Jun
should be the one using...

180
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:40,360
Park Tae Ho's slush fund.

181
00:12:40,430 --> 00:12:41,970
Wait, hold on.

182
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:44,200
This money is for a good cause.
So please, stop getting in the way.

183
00:12:44,270 --> 00:12:47,400
Exactly. Are you sure you want
Dan Hui to find out about this?

184
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:51,440
I'm pretty sure she's keeping
a huge secret on your behalf.

185
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:53,910
Move!

186
00:12:55,180 --> 00:12:56,210
Shoot.

187
00:12:57,050 --> 00:12:59,480
Park Min Jun,
get out here right now!

188
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,990
Don't touch my money,
and get out here.

189
00:13:02,620 --> 00:13:05,060
Don't just stand there.
Get that door open.

190
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:06,490
- What?
- No way.

191
00:13:11,930 --> 00:13:13,200
It's already too late.

192
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:16,230
What? What did you say?

193
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:20,640
I've already completed the transfers
to all the foundations.

194
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,450
(Hanbit Foundation,
1.3 million dollars)

195
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:34,820
Father!

196
00:13:35,390 --> 00:13:36,420
Honey!

197
00:13:41,630 --> 00:13:43,990
You actually went so far...

198
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:48,300
as to betray your own father?

199
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:02,250
Manager Kang!

200
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:04,480
Why are you calling
for Manager Kang?

201
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,150
He's the one who betrayed you.

202
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:14,060
Go and get Manager Kang right now.

203
00:14:14,530 --> 00:14:19,300
No, get Kim Dan Hui first.
Kim Dan Hui and Baek Jin Ju.

204
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,030
Kill them all!

205
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,670
Unbelievable.

206
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:25,740
That's going to be difficult.

207
00:14:25,870 --> 00:14:29,470
Taking a life isn't something
I do for free, you know.

208
00:14:29,810 --> 00:14:31,980
Why would I take orders
from someone who's broke?

209
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,140
What?

210
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:35,180
Broke?

211
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:39,050
Are you writing Park Tae Ho off?

212
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:40,580
Seriously!

213
00:14:42,490 --> 00:14:45,820
Honestly, if you're not the chairman
and you have no money,

214
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:47,630
then you're no different from me.

215
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:54,400
That doesn't make you his equal.

216
00:14:55,670 --> 00:14:56,970
My father is still...

217
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,600
Adele Group's largest shareholder.

218
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:01,740
That's right. I'm Park Tae Ho.

219
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:04,410
Do you think this is the end for me?

220
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:08,980
That slush fund is nothing.
I can always make more.

221
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:13,520
If you're so confident,
then pay me what you owe me first.

222
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:15,750
The position and the money
you promised me.

223
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:18,190
Take care of that first.

224
00:15:18,490 --> 00:15:20,420
If you can't wrap this up
in a few days,

225
00:15:20,490 --> 00:15:25,030
I can't guarantee I'll be able
to block the reinvestigation.

226
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:31,240
Why, that... Is he kidding me?
You punk!

227
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:34,270
Darn it. Hey, Hyun Jun.

228
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:37,210
Now, you have to do this right.

229
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,840
You'll have to find
Manager Kang somehow,

230
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,950
go up against Kim Dan Hui,

231
00:15:44,010 --> 00:15:46,520
and get the chairman's seat back.

232
00:15:58,030 --> 00:16:01,300
You used my dad just to steal
the chairman's slush fund?

233
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:03,730
That's right.
I couldn't let the chairman...

234
00:16:04,130 --> 00:16:06,040
use that money to kill again.

235
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:09,210
I couldn't let him hide the truth
and cover it up again.

236
00:16:10,610 --> 00:16:13,510
Now, the people who were only in it
for the money...

237
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:15,380
won't listen to you anymore.

238
00:16:16,050 --> 00:16:17,850
The problems you used
to buy your way out of...

239
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,350
will be much harder
to deal with now.

240
00:16:20,980 --> 00:16:22,120
Choi Yu Na.

241
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:24,050
Your lies...

242
00:16:24,620 --> 00:16:26,190
will all be revealed soon enough.

243
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:28,290
I see.

244
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:30,430
Was that your plan from the start?

245
00:16:31,630 --> 00:16:34,130
It was you who blackmailed him,
not Manager Kang.

246
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:38,740
Give me the audio file
from my dad's phone right now.

247
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:43,270
No, there was no such audio file.

248
00:16:43,410 --> 00:16:45,310
I made it up to fool Chairman Park.

249
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:46,810
Stop lying.

250
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:49,610
You might've fooled the chairman,
but you won't fool me.

251
00:16:49,950 --> 00:16:53,020
I know all about the last call
between my parents.

252
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:55,820
Where did you hide it?
Give it to me!

253
00:16:59,190 --> 00:17:00,220
What do you think you're doing?

254
00:17:01,130 --> 00:17:03,090
Then you tell me, Park Min Jun.

255
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:07,060
Where did you hide the audio file
from my dad's phone?

256
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:11,940
Didn't Jin Ju tell you?
There is no audio file.

257
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,100
Are you sure there isn't one?

258
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:21,310
Why?

259
00:17:21,710 --> 00:17:24,150
Are you worried Father
will get arrested because of it?

260
00:17:24,350 --> 00:17:26,780
Or are you just worried...

261
00:17:26,950 --> 00:17:29,320
you won't become chairman
if he's arrested?

262
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,820
Just answer the question.

263
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:32,560
If there had been an audio file,

264
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:33,920
we would've handed it over
to the police...

265
00:17:33,990 --> 00:17:35,560
and leaked it to the public already.

266
00:17:36,530 --> 00:17:37,560
Right.

267
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:40,230
It's not like you'd give me
a straight answer.

268
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:45,270
Forget it.
We'll just do things our own way.

269
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,110
That audio file...

270
00:17:56,850 --> 00:17:58,650
had better not be real.

271
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:01,350
Everything I got
for turning on my father?

272
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:03,690
I'm not losing them this time.

273
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:06,960
If you ruin this for me,
I'll be the one to kill you,

274
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,930
not the chairman.

275
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:19,940
Jin Ju, are you okay?

276
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,240
Jin Ju.

277
00:18:27,910 --> 00:18:29,180
Baek Jin Ju!

278
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:41,290
That's right.
I have the audio file of the call.

279
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:45,300
When I'm ready,
I'll hand it to the police,

280
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:47,500
and Park Tae Ho will be arrested.

281
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:51,030
So stop trying to protect him...

282
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:53,700
and ruining yourself.

283
00:18:54,740 --> 00:18:55,940
Don't think you've won...

284
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:57,980
just because
you drained his slush fund.

285
00:18:58,710 --> 00:19:00,580
Whether that audio file
exists or not,

286
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:03,050
I'll take back the chairman's seat.

287
00:19:03,050 --> 00:19:06,680
Still, you're not going to marry
Choi Yu Na, are you?

288
00:19:12,590 --> 00:19:13,590
Why?

289
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:16,660
What makes you think I wouldn't?

290
00:19:18,330 --> 00:19:19,700
Something like marriage...

291
00:19:22,430 --> 00:19:24,230
is a tool I can use if necessary.

292
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,000
Just like you.

293
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:15,150
I wanted to give Hyun Jun
a heads-up.

294
00:20:16,620 --> 00:20:18,260
Deceiving and using him?

295
00:20:18,660 --> 00:20:19,720
I just can't...

296
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:22,290
do it to him anymore.

297
00:20:23,490 --> 00:20:27,200
I'm also worried he'll be used
by Park Tae Ho or Choi Yu Na.

298
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:29,500
I see.

299
00:20:29,930 --> 00:20:32,770
If that's how you feel,
then that's what you should do.

300
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:37,310
Hyun Jun won't go around talking
about the audio file.

301
00:20:37,410 --> 00:20:40,880
At least he'll keep you
out of harm's way.

302
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:42,310
Right.

303
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,700
Help yourselves.

304
00:21:02,630 --> 00:21:05,600
Feels like ten years of weight
just lifted off my shoulders.

305
00:21:06,140 --> 00:21:08,910
That piece of trash Park Tae Ho
lost his position,

306
00:21:09,010 --> 00:21:10,270
had his slush fund wiped out,

307
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:12,910
and even lost Manager Kang,
his right-hand man.

308
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:14,180
Tell me about it.

309
00:21:14,610 --> 00:21:16,980
We've really managed
to take a lot from him.

310
00:21:17,050 --> 00:21:19,780
But we can't let our guard down yet.

311
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:22,290
The Adele Group's chairman election
is still to come.

312
00:21:22,350 --> 00:21:26,790
Yes. We took the chairman's seat
and the slush fund from Park Tae Ho,

313
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:28,590
but he still has his shares,

314
00:21:28,590 --> 00:21:30,430
and we haven't found
the slush fund ledger yet.

315
00:21:31,090 --> 00:21:34,360
We can't rest until we've taken
everything from him.

316
00:21:34,500 --> 00:21:36,700
True. So, what's our next move?

317
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:39,170
We got Manager Kang
out of the picture,

318
00:21:39,370 --> 00:21:41,000
so now it's Deputy Chief Yun's turn.

319
00:21:41,340 --> 00:21:43,570
We should release
Choi Sam Sik's audio file...

320
00:21:43,840 --> 00:21:45,410
and push for a reinvestigation.

321
00:21:46,340 --> 00:21:49,050
Deputy Chief Yun
only cares about money.

322
00:21:49,050 --> 00:21:52,820
If Park Tae Ho doesn't pay up,
he'll look out for himself first.

323
00:21:53,320 --> 00:21:55,720
We have to use this window
to keep Park Tae Ho...

324
00:21:55,790 --> 00:21:57,590
from getting in the way
of the investigation.

325
00:21:57,950 --> 00:22:01,790
Yes, Park Hyun Jun and Choi Yu Na
suspect that we have the audio file.

326
00:22:02,260 --> 00:22:04,800
We should hurry
before they can interfere.

327
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:12,940
All right, let's celebrate
what we accomplished today...

328
00:22:12,940 --> 00:22:14,340
and toast
to the work ahead tomorrow.

329
00:22:14,340 --> 00:22:17,440
He's right. Let's eat
before the food gets cold.

330
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:19,580
- All right.
- Cheers!

331
00:22:21,210 --> 00:22:22,550
How am I supposed to lift this?

332
00:22:24,180 --> 00:22:25,180
It's fun, isn't it?

333
00:22:25,250 --> 00:22:28,350
It's hilarious. Please dig in.
Start with the meat.

334
00:22:28,420 --> 00:22:29,520
Eat what?

335
00:22:38,760 --> 00:22:40,100
Kim Dan Hui.

336
00:22:40,700 --> 00:22:41,970
Baek Jin Ju.

337
00:22:43,970 --> 00:22:45,840
I'm going to kill them all.

338
00:22:46,900 --> 00:22:51,370
I'm going to kill them!
How dare you?

339
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:58,250
I'll kill them. I'll kill them all!

340
00:23:31,010 --> 00:23:33,250
Father-in-law!

341
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:34,850
What did I tell you?

342
00:23:36,850 --> 00:23:39,690
I told you that you would end up
losing everything.

343
00:23:40,460 --> 00:23:44,390
Your days are numbered.

344
00:23:45,830 --> 00:23:50,100
No, that's not true.
I'm the great Park Tae Ho.

345
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:52,240
It won't end like this!

346
00:23:52,970 --> 00:23:54,270
You scoundrel.

347
00:23:54,910 --> 00:23:57,270
This is how it ends for you.

348
00:23:57,970 --> 00:24:02,180
You stole my Munhwadang
and had zero regard for human life.

349
00:24:02,180 --> 00:24:04,920
You'll pay for it with your life.

350
00:24:05,380 --> 00:24:07,520
No, you're wrong.

351
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:10,790
I can't lose everything like this.

352
00:24:11,590 --> 00:24:16,230
It won't end like this for me.
It won't!

353
00:24:16,390 --> 00:24:19,400
I refuse to go down!

354
00:24:21,300 --> 00:24:25,270
Go away.
Get out of here right now. Get out.

355
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:29,470
Stay away from me!

356
00:24:47,390 --> 00:24:50,530
I can't lose to people
who are already dead.

357
00:24:52,800 --> 00:24:54,830
I killed them with my own hands.

358
00:24:55,530 --> 00:24:57,230
How could they possibly
bring me down?

359
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,570
Whatever was taken from me...

360
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:02,610
I'll get it back, one by one!

361
00:25:07,010 --> 00:25:10,310
I'll just eliminate anything
that gets in my way.

362
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:13,320
I'll just get rid of them!

363
00:25:13,650 --> 00:25:15,590
I'll get rid of them all!

364
00:25:18,460 --> 00:25:20,160
I won't go down.

365
00:25:20,660 --> 00:25:23,560
I won't go down. Never!

366
00:25:28,100 --> 00:25:30,730
(Munhwadang)

367
00:25:31,670 --> 00:25:33,170
Mr. Moon.

368
00:25:34,870 --> 00:25:36,610
It won't be that much longer now.

369
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:39,180
The day...

370
00:25:39,910 --> 00:25:41,910
you finally get justice...

371
00:25:44,250 --> 00:25:45,950
is not far off.

372
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:03,130
What about Manager Kang?
Did you find anything?

373
00:26:05,240 --> 00:26:07,870
He planned this escape.
You think he'd be easy to find?

374
00:26:08,070 --> 00:26:09,470
In all that chaos,

375
00:26:09,570 --> 00:26:11,470
he even managed
to take his family with him.

376
00:26:12,010 --> 00:26:13,440
I don't know where they went,

377
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:15,880
but his mother's gone
from the nursing home too.

378
00:26:15,980 --> 00:26:17,880
Just forget it.

379
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:21,320
Even if we catch him, it's not like
we'll get the slush fund back.

380
00:26:22,190 --> 00:26:24,290
Let's pretend to look for him
for a while and then drop it.

381
00:26:24,990 --> 00:26:27,920
Hyun Jun, you just focus
on becoming chairman.

382
00:26:31,590 --> 00:26:34,530
From now on,
don't go anywhere by yourself.

383
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:38,300
Even if my father asks to see you,
don't go.

384
00:26:44,810 --> 00:26:47,210
Jin Ju, can we talk?

385
00:26:48,650 --> 00:26:49,650
What?

386
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:52,550
It feels like
I'm the only one talking.

387
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:56,890
Gosh, haven't I said anything?

388
00:26:57,750 --> 00:27:00,990
Yes. You've only been thinking
about Hyun Jun.

389
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,300
The fact that Hyun Jun...

390
00:27:09,930 --> 00:27:11,940
might marry Choi Yu Na...

391
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:15,070
Are you really
that worried about it?

392
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,010
It's not that I'm worried, just...

393
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:21,410
You are worried.

394
00:27:22,510 --> 00:27:23,510
That's what that is.

395
00:27:26,150 --> 00:27:29,450
Honestly, I really didn't want
to say this, but...

396
00:27:35,030 --> 00:27:36,030
Feeling sorry for him,

397
00:27:37,630 --> 00:27:38,660
worrying about him,

398
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,030
and thinking about him.

399
00:27:42,900 --> 00:27:45,100
If that's what's making you
want to see Hyun Jun,

400
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:49,270
then that feeling...

401
00:27:51,840 --> 00:27:52,940
is probably love.

402
00:28:00,450 --> 00:28:01,450
What?

403
00:28:01,650 --> 00:28:04,850
Take a good look at
where your heart...

404
00:28:06,620 --> 00:28:07,760
is headed.

405
00:28:38,090 --> 00:28:40,990
(Chairman Candidate Interview,
Wednesday, July 22 at 1:00 p.m.)

406
00:29:03,850 --> 00:29:05,650
An interview
for the chairman candidate?

407
00:29:07,220 --> 00:29:10,420
They're calling in Kim Dan Hui
and Hyun Jun for an interview?

408
00:29:11,890 --> 00:29:14,220
Is it just a formality
before the board's vote?

409
00:29:14,890 --> 00:29:16,160
Even if it's just a formality,

410
00:29:16,760 --> 00:29:18,630
we shouldn't dismiss it.

411
00:29:19,230 --> 00:29:21,700
The directors
have been wavering lately.

412
00:29:22,270 --> 00:29:23,270
How so?

413
00:29:23,830 --> 00:29:24,830
Well,

414
00:29:25,140 --> 00:29:28,740
the payments you were sending them
have stopped.

415
00:29:29,710 --> 00:29:32,980
What? After all the money
they've already taken?

416
00:29:33,540 --> 00:29:35,310
If money matters to them that much,

417
00:29:35,310 --> 00:29:37,010
tell them they must vote
for Hyun Jun.

418
00:29:37,380 --> 00:29:38,680
It's the only way
those payments continue.

419
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:41,120
If Kim Dan Hui gets their vote,
they get nothing.

420
00:29:41,620 --> 00:29:42,650
Unbelievable.

421
00:29:43,820 --> 00:29:46,690
Jung Ran, it's way too early
to get worked up.

422
00:29:48,060 --> 00:29:49,130
It's the directors.

423
00:29:49,660 --> 00:29:52,830
Apparently they're wavering over
missing a month or two of payments.

424
00:29:53,260 --> 00:29:54,560
Today's
the chairman candidate interview,

425
00:29:54,630 --> 00:29:56,400
and the board meeting
is right around the corner.

426
00:29:57,670 --> 00:30:00,370
Those money-hungry fools
are really going too far.

427
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,810
Their loyalty was bought with money,

428
00:30:02,810 --> 00:30:04,710
so of course they'll leave
once the money's gone.

429
00:30:05,180 --> 00:30:06,580
With Park Tae Ho's slush fund gone,

430
00:30:06,640 --> 00:30:07,780
we don't have any money to spend.

431
00:30:09,110 --> 00:30:11,210
This won't do.
Call the directors in right now.

432
00:30:11,210 --> 00:30:13,780
I'll threaten them for their votes
if I have to.

433
00:30:13,780 --> 00:30:14,780
Hold on a second.

434
00:30:15,290 --> 00:30:17,690
That's not
what's important right now.

435
00:30:17,790 --> 00:30:19,520
Then what is?

436
00:30:19,790 --> 00:30:21,360
Our Hyun Jun's...

437
00:30:22,190 --> 00:30:23,530
secret.

438
00:30:24,860 --> 00:30:27,360
If Kim Dan Hui tries
to take the chairman seat...

439
00:30:27,730 --> 00:30:30,030
by exposing Hyun Jun's secret,
then...

440
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:40,480
Are you saying...

441
00:30:41,580 --> 00:30:43,110
President Kim Dan Hui...

442
00:30:45,150 --> 00:30:46,150
knows too?

443
00:30:46,550 --> 00:30:48,150
Well...

444
00:30:49,150 --> 00:30:50,250
It's just that...

445
00:30:57,630 --> 00:31:00,230
This is just a simple interview
before the chairman election, right?

446
00:31:00,630 --> 00:31:03,100
Yes. Since Park Tae Ho
wasn't arrested,

447
00:31:03,100 --> 00:31:05,370
Hyun Jun was approved
as a candidate.

448
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:07,400
It seems they want
to run an evaluation...

449
00:31:07,470 --> 00:31:08,710
before the board votes.

450
00:31:09,940 --> 00:31:13,240
If the situation turns against you
during the chairman election,

451
00:31:13,980 --> 00:31:15,010
what will you do?

452
00:31:15,880 --> 00:31:18,580
Are you planning to leverage
Hyun Jun's secret?

453
00:31:29,590 --> 00:31:32,630
What are you going to do
about those two?

454
00:31:36,070 --> 00:31:37,430
I'll make them pay...

455
00:31:38,870 --> 00:31:40,100
in the most painful...

456
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:43,010
and agonizing way.

457
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:14,140
(Pearl in Red)

458
00:32:14,140 --> 00:32:17,840
Yu Na, stop now.
I'll pay for everything instead,

459
00:32:18,210 --> 00:32:21,640
so please just stop this.
Yu Na, please.

460
00:32:21,710 --> 00:32:23,810
I've come too far to stop now.

461
00:32:23,810 --> 00:32:24,880
Yu Na!

462
00:32:25,050 --> 00:32:26,050
Find Moon Tae Jin.

463
00:32:26,150 --> 00:32:28,380
The major shareholder
who's been impossible to find?

464
00:32:28,720 --> 00:32:31,820
- But he's on Kim Dan Hui's side.
- Exactly.

465
00:32:32,220 --> 00:32:34,620
We have to meet him somehow
and change his mind.

466
00:32:35,060 --> 00:32:36,430
What do you think you're doing?

467
00:32:36,960 --> 00:32:38,830
Today, you'll learn...

468
00:32:38,830 --> 00:32:42,630
what a blessing it was to live
as Park Tae Ho's son!

469
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:46,370
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
